    <section>
      <h2>Income</h2>
      <p>
        Regarding event funding, the fixed income streams detailed in the subsequent table represent
        confirmed commitments from established institutional partners and bodies closely affiliated
        with AISF. These entities have already formally expressed their willingness to support the
        organization of ICPS. Conversely, the projected external funding allocated under the
        "Sponsors" entry is thoroughly detailed and broken down in the dedicated section immediately
        following the budget profiles.
      </p>
      <DataTable
        headers={['Description', 'Num. of Units', 'Price / Unit (€)', 'Total (€)']}
        rows={[
          ['Participants Fees', 472, '200.00', '94,400.00'],
          ['Department of Physics - UniTO', 1, '10,000.00', '10,000.00'],
          ['Department of Physics - UniMI/MIB', 1, '10,000.00', '10,000.00'],
