      <p>
        The budget estimates are based on current market prices for full day charter coach rentals
        and educational group admission fees. The estimates include transportation from Milano to
        the selected destinations and onward to Torino, as well as entrance fees where applicable.
        Meals and contingency funds are intentionally excluded, as they are covered separately
        within the overall conference budget. Activities at each destination are designed to be
        freely accessible and therefore do not require additional organizational expenses.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Budget assumptions</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Chartered coach (50 seats), full-day service (Milano → excursion destination → Torino):
          €1,450 per coach
        </li>
        <li>Aquarium of Genoa (group rate): €22 per participant</li>
      </ul>

